{"chroma:document":"# Windows Troubleshooting\n\n## General Windows Application Problems\n\nTroubleshooting:\n\n1. Restart the affected application.\n2. Restart the system if appropriate.\n3. Check Windows Event Viewer.\n4. Verify available system resources.\n5. Check whether recent software changes caused the problem.\n6. Verify required services are running.","chunk_id":"0","source":"windows.md"